ea6cb6b71321a6efe5e8c0aba41a2d35f60b3c28a88a1dc4cd0eb3888640b83f  VST-33 (0.25.0 engine, first pin): tests/core_parity.c through the seq_* API alone, two passes (44100 Hz / 128 frames, 48000 Hz / 256 frames) of the same script; 682 lines, 329 note-ons, 569 events at a nonzero in-block frame. The same bytes from gcc 12 under ASan/UBSan (Docker) and clang on arm64 Apple. Both passes play the same notes (tests/test_threads.c checks it order-free); the frames differ by block size, as they should.
